From 4d62ff25660513c928563e8e1ed004bc6e4f98e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wasm64 port <wasm64@localhost>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 11:28:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wasm64 port: drop the Batteries umbrella import

The wasm64 build's essential Mathlib pack has no `Batteries.olean` umbrella
(75 Batteries modules are present and arrive through `Mathlib.Tactic.Common`,
which Game/Metadata/FromMathlib.lean imports). Everything else Robo needs from
outside the pack (Mathlib.Tactic.{Have,Cases,Generalize},
Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Star, Mathlib.Data.{Int,Rat}.Star) is provided by
wasm/compat under its real module name, so no other source change is needed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Game/Metadata.lean | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Game/Metadata.lean b/Game/Metadata.lean
index 22fd996..28a7568 100644
--- a/Game/Metadata.lean
+++ b/Game/Metadata.lean
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
-import Batteries
+-- wasm64 port: the `Batteries` umbrella module is not in the essential pack
+-- (its contents arrive through `Mathlib.Tactic.Common` below).
 import GameServer
 import Game.Doc
 
